{
  "identifier": "dataturcyl-lod-for-tourists-in-castilla-y-leon-spain",
  "title": "DATATURCYL - LOD for tourists in Castilla y León (Spain)",
  "description": {
    "en": "The aim of this project, called DATATURCYL, is to reuse and redistribute open data provided by the Junta de Castilla y León to enrich and enhance information services about tourism in the community. To provide them with an added value, this project embraces the Linked Open Data philosophy. In our particular case, the information for tourism (bars, restaurants, hotels, etc.) is converted to RDF and enriched with geographic data sources and open knowledge in Dbpedia."
  },
